            "topicId": "0580-igcse-topic-04",
            "sectionCode": "C4.2",
            "outcomeNumber": 3,
            "officialText": "Draw, use and interpret nets. A ruler should be used for all straight edges. Constructions of perpendicular bisectors and angle bisectors are not required. e.g. construct a rhombus by drawing two triangles. Construction arcs must be shown.",
