            "topicId": "9700-a2-topic-01",
            "sectionCode": "12.1",
            "outcomeNumber": 1,
            "officialText": "outline the need for energy in living organisms, as illustrated by active transport, movement and anabolic reactions, such as those occurring in DNA replication and protein synthesis",
