            "sectionCode": "12.2",
            "outcomeNumber": 1,
            "officialText": "State where each of the four stages in aerobic respiration occurs in eukaryotic cells:",
            "officialPage": 34,
            "sourceSha256": "81A421CEEB4B9C747385592326A67967C9E24DF4AABCCA6A24CEBC2F024E07CC",
