            "topicId": "9700-a2-topic-05",
            "sectionCode": "16.3",
            "outcomeNumber": 2,
            "officialText": "explain genetic control of protein production in a prokaryote using the lac operon (knowledge of the role of cAMP is not expected)",
            "officialPage": 43,
