            "topicId": "9700-a2-topic-05",
            "sectionCode": "16.3",
            "outcomeNumber": 3,
            "officialText": "state that transcription factors are proteins that bind to DNA and are involved in the control of gene expression in eukaryotes by decreasing or increasing the rate of transcription",
            "officialPage": 43,
