            "officialText": "(a) understand what is meant by a reversible reaction (b) understand what is meant by dynamic equilibrium in terms of the rate of forward and reverse reactions being equal and the concentration of reactants and products remaining constant (c) understand the need for a closed system in order to establish dynamic equilibrium",
