            "topicId": "physics-9702-topic-13",
            "sectionCode": "13.4",
            "outcomeNumber": 3,
            "officialText": "understand how the concept of gravitational potential leads to the gravitational potential energy of two point masses and use EP = –GMm / r 14 Temperature",
