            "id": "physics-9702-point-15-2-02",
            "topicId": "physics-9702-topic-15",
            "sectionCode": "15.2",
            "outcomeNumber": 2,
            "officialText": "recall and use the equation of state for an ideal gas expressed as pV = nRT, where n = amount of substance (number of moles) and as pV = NkT, where N = number of molecules",
            "officialPage": 28,
            "sourceSha256": "468F4A01B9459701E5B21A010FDE12538AA16413A25496C311F7CE6FDD585E8C",
