            "sectionCode": "16.2",
            "outcomeNumber": 2,
            "officialText": "recall and use the first law of thermodynamics ∆U = q + W expressed in terms of the increase in internal energy, the heating of the system (energy transferred to the system by heating) and the work done on the system 17 Oscillations",
