          "where nt is a unit vector, or in component form",
          "as",
          "ab ab ab abij23 32 31 13−− +`` jj ab ab k12 21−+`j",
          "• use equations of lines and planes, together with",
          "scalar and vector products where appropriate,",
          "to solve problems concerning distances, angles",
